      "w": 990,
      "h": 122
    },
    {
      "text": "Chenot’s Chief Operating and Scientific Officer, Dr. George Gaitanos explains the Chenot Method ®, our world-renowned protocol for optimising your health, resetting – or even reversing – biological ag",
      "fontFamily": "Verlag, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20.8px",
      "fontWeight": "300",
