      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)",
      "backgroundColor": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
      "x": 742,
      "y": 2154,
      "w": 621,
      "h": 91
    },
    {
      "text": "At Chenot, we do not treat disease. Instead, we address the root cause: ageing. Ageing as a process, and our goal is to support your own body’s natural healing mechanisms to repair and rejuvenate from",
      "fontFamily": "Verlag, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "30px",
      "fontWeight": "300",
