      "letterSpacing": "0.3px",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)",
      "backgroundColor": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
      "x": 742,
      "y": 2499,
      "w": 621,
      "h": 252
    },
    {
      "text": "Think of each of your cells as a battery. With time they become rusty and lose energy. They accumulate damage and lose their ability to recharge. The Chenot Method ® has been designed to clean the bat",
      "fontFamily": "Verlag, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20.8px",
      "fontWeight": "300",
      "lineHeight": "30.368px",
      "letterSpacing": "0.208px",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)",
      "backgroundColor": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
      "x": 742,
      "y": 3218,
      "w": 621,
      "h": 152
    },
    {
      "text": "80% of your health is influenced by your lifestyle, and only 20% is predetermined by your genes. Our unique advanced diagnostics, the Chenot Lifestyle Biomarkers®, act as a monitoring system to measur",
      "fontFamily": "Verlag, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20.8px",
      "fontWeight": "300",
      "lineHeight": "30.368px",
      "letterSpacing": "0.208px",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)",
      "backgroundColor": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
      "x": 742,
      "y": 5165,
      "w": 621,
      "h": 182
    },
    {
      "text": "Hormesis is central to the Chenot Method ®. Its unique application integrates and transmits signals of controlled stress to the body. The activation of energy channels, stimulation of physiological fu",
      "fontFamily": "Verlag, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "30px",
      "fontWeight": "300",
      "lineHeight": "36px",
      "letterSpacing": "0.3px",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)",
      "backgroundColor": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
      "x": 742,
      "y": 5459,
      "w": 621,
      "h": 360
    },
    {
      "text": "Informed by over half a century of ongoing evidence-based research and created by our talented team of chefs and nutritional scientists, the Chenot Diet® delivers 850 calories across three meals a day",
      "fontFamily": "Verlag, sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20.8px",
      "fontWeight": "300",
      "lineHeight": "30.368px",
      "letterSpacing": "0.208px",
